---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service | Winston Koh">
  <main class="legal-page">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
      <p><strong>Last Updated: January 2026</strong></p>

      <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
      <p>By accessing this website, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree, strictly do not use this site.</p>

      <h2>2. Services</h2>
      <p>Winston Koh provides AI Systems Architecture and consulting services. All services are governed by separate agreements or contracts signed at the time of engagement.</p>

      <h2>3. Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p>All content on this site (code snippets, articles, case studies) is the intellectual property of Winston Koh unless otherwise stated. You may not reproduce it without permission.</p>

      <h2>4. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>The information on this website is provided "as is". We make no warranties regarding accuracy or completeness. In no event shall Winston Koh be liable for any damages arising out of the use or inability to use this site.</p>
      
      <h2>5. Client Responsibilities (The "Willy Clause")</h2>
      <p>Clients are solely responsible for executing instructions provided during consulting sessions. We are not liable for data loss, system failure, or business disruption caused by client negligence, failure to backup data, or incorrect execution of advice.</p>

      <h2>6. Governing Law</h2>
      <p>These terms are governed by the laws of Singapore.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    padding: 8rem 2rem;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    color: #e0e0e0;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    background: linear-gradient(45deg, #fff, #888);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: #fff;
  }
  p {
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: #ccc;
  }
  .container {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: 12px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  }
</style>
